:: notebook-intro-content [nobr]

<<timed 0.1s>>
<<append "#mount">>
<<type 60ms>>
<p>Up with the jolly old lark. Sun hardly peeping over the horizon. Not your usual habit, I hasten to add, but today you have a mystery to solve.</p>
<</type>>
<</append>>
<</timed>>

<<timed 6s>>
<<append "#mount">>
<<type 60ms>>
<p>You've woken up refreshed</p>
